217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 409 0 R
/E (PostgreSQL Date Formatting Errors: During the initial bulk data ingestion, PostgreSQL threw a date/time field value out of range error because the CSV date format did not match the default database expectations.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 410 0 R
/E (Solution: Executed the SET datestyle TO 'ISO, DMY'; command to explicitly configure the database session's date format prior to running the COPY function.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 411 0 R
/E (Continuous Variable Grouping for Visuals: The raw customer dataset contained exact ages and exact incomes, which are difficult to visualize effectively in bar charts and segment analysis.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 412 0 R
/E (Solution: Utilized Power BI's DAX SWITCH function to engineer new calculated columns \(AgeGroup and IncomeGroup\) that automatically categorized these continuous numerical values into standardized demographic buckets \(e.g., "40-50" years old, "High" income\). )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
