/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (This project successfully transformed static, disconnected CSV files into a dynamic, real-time Credit Card Financial Dashboard using a robust PostgreSQL and Power BI stack. By automating data ingestion and leveraging advanced DAX measures, the dashboard now provides stakeholders with immediate visibility into critical metrics such as weekly revenue growth, demographic profitability, and portfolio risk. Ultimately, this streamlined data processing pipeline eliminates manual reporting and empowers the business to make rapid, data-driven decisions for targeted marketing and product optimization. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
